  "limitations": [
    "Actual pinned bare wheels only; hubs, shafts, bearings, motor mounts, guide rails and belt clamps are NOT assembled",
    "Original catcher world retained at400mm and floor-resting body center; no relocation of the existing catcher",
    "Side-pad volumes must be removed/replaced, so earlier pad-retention dynamics and control validation do not carry over",
    "Swept AABB proof is conservative for fixed wheel orientation and60mm lateral translation;2mm total translation error plus2mm clearance only",
    "32/40mm slot comparison is original modification, not manufacturing drawing or structural qualification",
    "Body-wheel intersection is assumed rigid interference, not friction, preload or force acceptance",
    "Belt path and footprint estimates do not establish actual opposed-leg linkage or packaging fit",
    "Original FUEL moving-nip no-contact counterexample remains unchanged; retained pregrip is a different architecture needing fresh control/contact integration",
    "No installed target transform or scoring"
  ],
